/**
 * Workspace Session Manager
 *
 * High-level API for workspace-scoped session management with:
 * - Automatic session refresh via BetterAuth (or injected refresh function)
 * - Single-flight pattern for concurrent refresh prevention
 * - Backwards compatibility with global credentials
 * - Integration with existing secure storage
 *
 * @module workspace-session-manager
 */
